<p>
  {dgettext("help_features", "When you are")} <code>{dgettext("help_features", "/away")}</code>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "and someone sends you a private message, the system automatically replies with your away message."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_features", "How It Works")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_features", "1. Set yourself away:")}
  <code>{dgettext("help_features", "/away Gone for lunch")}</code>
  <br />{dgettext("help_features", "2. When someone PMs you, they see:")}
  <em>{dgettext("help_features", "YourNick is away: Gone for lunch")}</em>
  <br />{dgettext("help_features", "3. The auto-reply is sent only")}
  <strong>{dgettext("help_features", "once per unique sender")}</strong> {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "until you return."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_document_alert}>{dgettext("help_features", "Notes")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Auto-replies are NOT sent for notices (per IRC convention). The replied-to set resets when you clear your away status."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_btn_away}>
  {dgettext("help_features", "Using the Set Away Dialog")}
</.help_h4>
<ol>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "Open the File menu and choose Set Away...")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "Check I'm away and type your text in Away message.")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "Click Set Away. The dialog shows a small preview of the reply that people will receive."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_features", "When you are back, open the dialog again and click Clear Away.")}
  </li>
</ol>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_features", "Commands")}</.help_h4>
<pre>/away Gone for lunch
/away</pre>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The first line sets you away with a message. The second line, with no text, marks you as back."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_features", "What You See")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "The chat confirms that you are now away, and later that you are no longer away."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "Each time an auto-reply goes out, your Status window shows a line with the sender's nickname. You can see who wrote to you while you were gone."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "The reply appears in the private conversation, so the sender sees it right after their own message."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_document_alert}>{dgettext("help_features", "Rules")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Only private messages trigger the reply. Channel messages and mentions do not. Setting a new away message also starts a new round, so each sender gets the new text once."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p><.help_link topic="cmd-away">{dgettext("help_features", "/away Command")}</.help_link></p>
